ment where everything  is is translated from english to french  or from french to english and so that  gave them sort of massive massive  amounts of of content whereby the  computer could identify patterns  and the way we learned i think is very  much that way  obviously some theoretical  grammatical explanation can help it's  not harm but more than that just as with  the computer  we have to let the brain identify  patterns  by massive exposure  but that exposure  you do need to move on to new stuff you  can't just stay with the same old stuff  all the time  okay  bit of a ramble there bye for now  [Music]  you

